{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"valid\": true,\n  \"entry\": \"第一眼落在左上方两行大号白色标题，随后容易被下方紫色放大的“少露些心意，会不会少疼些？”吸引。\",\n  \"grasp_who\": \"能看出是在一段亲密关系中，想听对方承诺以后也不变，渴望关系持续；更具体的处境不确定。\",\n  \"grasp_feel\": \"期待、依恋、隐约不安。\",\n  \"missed\": \"相处时间飞快带来的失落和对未来的担忧；从害怕自己的需要成为负担，转为害怕对方不再需要自己；想收起心意却发现真心藏不回去。\",\n  \"burden\": [\n    \"上方标题虽然最显眼，但两行长句包含想听承诺、相处时间飞快、担心能否持续等多层意思，快速扫视未必能一次拿全。\",\n    \"下方同样醒目的大字块与紫色强调语争夺注意力，具体处境和核心感受分散在上下两块，需要拼接才能完整理解。\",\n    \"紫色放大的“少露些心意，会不会少疼些？”本身能传达情绪，但单独看不出具体处境。\",\n    \"中间灰色小字连续分两列排列，补充信息较密，需要进一步阅读才能理解心理变化。\"\n  ],\n  \"score\": 2\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "954e4d7b-170d-45b1-848d-6805ae844bcd", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261110T022124956410Z", "elapsed_seconds": 55.875, "completed_utc": "2026-11-10T02:22:20.824482+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "9ca64ad417475513d5054ce6a144fcfb5858e6157c35dd8e787525196de72160", "attachment_count": 1}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 1, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_